ED mode=observe readOnly=true blocking=false; acceptance_rollout_report_read FAIL receipt=stale quorum=full-3x2 codes=AR_REPORT_STALE; acceptance_rollout_check FAIL promotionEligible=false mode=observe blocking=false codes=AR_REPORT_STALE. All four are non-PASS but every one reports blocking=false with project mode=observe, and this work makes no PASS/promotion claim (the only diff lines mentioning 3 rounds x 2 hosts are the agent-template honesty rubric itself), so under the docs-lane contract these are advisory only and are not upgraded to a formal pass and no topology is fabricated. No blockers for the documentation-code consistency lane.",
